### Administrador de RabbitMQ de BarrioDigital
### Para VS Code (REST Client) o IntelliJ. Define el token en la variable @token.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8086
@token = PEGAR_AQUI_EL_JWT_DE_ENTRA_ID_CON_ROL_ADMIN

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Colas

### Crear una cola (201). Repetirla da 409; un nombre inválido da 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "q.prueba",
  "durable": true,
  "autoDelete": false,
  "deadLetterExchange": "cmd.dead.dlx",
  "deadLetterRoutingKey": "email.dlq",
  "messageTtlMs": 60000
}

### Listar colas (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar una cola (200; 404 si no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/queues/q.prueba
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vaciar una cola (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/queues/q.prueba/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar una cola (204; las q.cmd.* dan 409)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/queues/q.prueba
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------- Exchanges

### Crear un exchange: tipo DIRECT, TOPIC, FANOUT o HEADERS (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ex.prueba",
  "type": "TOPIC"
}

### Listar exchanges (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar un exchange (204; cmd.* da 409, amq.* da 400)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/exchanges/ex.prueba
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------- Bindings

### Crear un binding exchange -> cola (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exchange": "ex.prueba",
  "queue": "q.prueba",
  "routingKey": "prueba.#"
}

### Listar los bindings de una cola (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/bindings?queue=q.prueba
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar un binding (204). El # de la routing key va como %23
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/bindings?exchange=ex.prueba&queue=q.prueba&routingKey=prueba.%23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leer los mensajes de una DLQ (solo colas *.dlq; no los consume)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rabbit/queues/q.cmd.crew.dlq/messages?count=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
